<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-5</name><desc>H-5 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It's 6.9 km from Elshani to near Velestovo, with about 303 m of climbing and 127 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 878 m and 1,181 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-5/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
